 limits=['Human preference labels are costly and inconsistent.','Models can over-optimise the reward and drift into odd behaviour.','Kalai et al. (2025) argue training and grading reward guessing over saying "I don\'t know".'],
 qa=['After any model update, re-run refusal, safety and instruction-following tests.','Watch for sycophancy (agreeing with the user when wrong) and over-refusal.','Test determinism at your chosen temperature.','Pin model IDs; behaviour shifts between versions.'],
